*.log

# Task renders: `arc-lab show <id>` writes <task_id>.png to the CWD by default
/*.png

# Run artifacts: a local cache, gitignored. A run is a pure function of its coordinates
# (deterministic, no RNG), so artifacts regenerate exactly via `arc-lab analyze`/`learn`
# and would otherwise churn on every code change. The durable record lives elsewhere: the
# committed testbeds/ (inputs) + EXPERIMENTS.md (findings). Inspect locally with `arc-lab runs`.
runs/

# Private working notes (also denied to Claude via .claude/settings.json)
_notes/
